 across all the classes. With years of market experience and a rich bag of clients, it has provided its customers a rich living experience with the best housing infrastructure.\n\n## Fairdeal Ocean 360 - Neighbourhood\n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Malabar Hill Area\n\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/caret-right-bold.svg)","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/fairdeal-ocean-360","title":"Fairdeal Ocean 360 In Malabar Hill | Buy 1 & 3 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n![hamburger-primary](/assets/icons/hamburger-primary.svg)\n![building-primary](/assets/icons/building-primary.svg)\n![developer-primary](/assets/icons/developer-primary.svg)\n![users-primary](/assets/icons/users-primary.svg)\n![blogs-primary](/assets/icons/blogs-primary.svg)\n![pressmentions-primary](/assets/icons/pressmentions-primary.svg)\n![phone-primary](/assets/icons/phone-primary.svg)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/fair-deal-infrastructure-fairdeal-ocean-360-elevation-1684411458.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/fair-deal-infrastructure-fairdeal-ocean-360-elevation-1684411468.webp)\n![Property-Image](