 in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### What is the price range of Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### Where is Fairdeal Ocean 360 located?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### What configurations are available in Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### What is the status of Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n### Who is the developer of Fairdeal Ocean 360?\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Fairdeal Ocean 360:Fair Deal Infrastructure](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/180523051706-newproject-2023-05-18t171335344.webp)\n\n## Fair Deal Infrastructure\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anchor-daewoo-industries-anchor-south-ridge-elevation-1714635669.webp)\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/020524124927-newproject-2024-05-02t124915257.webp)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-elevation-1688543205.webp)\n![Vinod 36 Babulnath](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/050723124954-newproject-2023-07-05t124859366.webp)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-elevation-1678787960.webp)\n![Runwal The Residence](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241024024654-runwal-logo-1.webp)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/jaycee-homes-jaycee-pearl-bedroom-1678455198.webp)\n![Jaycee Pearl](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/100323055708-newproject-2023-03-10t175402438.webp)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/kanakia-spaces-realty-kanakia-miami-1746530985.jpg)\n![Kanakia Miami](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/031121043629-download.jpeg)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/s-raheja-realty-fairfield-elevation-1681539944.webp)\n![S Raheja Fairfield](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/130922064257-newproject-20.jpg)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Ajmera-Ajmera_Treon--Bedroom-1656506434.webp)\n![Ajmera Treon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/201221110842-AJMERA.png)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/lodha-group-lodha-divino-elevation-1748599089.jpg)\n![Lodha Divino](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121063046-Lodha.png)\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n## Properties for sale in Mumbai\n\n## Property by budget in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n## Developers in Malabar Hill , Mumbai\n\n## Property by configuration in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n## Projects by construction status in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n### EXPLORE\n\nReferral\n\n### CITIES WE SERVE\n\n### FOLLOW US\n\n![facebook-primary](/assets/icons/facebook-primary.svg)\n![instagram-primary](/assets/icons/instagram-primary.svg)\n![linkedin-primary](/assets/icons/linkedin-primary.svg)\n![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)\n![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)\n![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\n© Copyright 2026 Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/fair-deal-ocean-360/29036/project","title":"Fair Deal Ocean 360, Walkeshwar, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹6.87 Cr Onwards | 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Fair Deal Infrastructure developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/developer-img.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Fair Deal Ocean 360 Walkeshwar, Mumbai\n\n![Fair Deal Ocean 360 Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/fair-deal-ocean-360-project-project-large-image1-6362.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Fair Deal Ocean 360 Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/fair-deal-ocean-360-project-floor-plans1-1390.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Fair Deal Ocean 360 Gymnasium Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/fair-deal-ocean-360-project-gymnasium-image1-4552.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Fair Deal Ocean 360 Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-fair-deal-ocean-360-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹6.87 Cr - 7.58 Cr**\n\n₹61,379 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Fair Deal Ocean 360?\n\n## About Fair Deal Ocean 360, Walkeshwar by Fair Deal Infrastructure\n\nIntroducing Fair Deal Ocean 360, a premier residential project located in the heart of Walkeshwar, offering unmatched living experiences. Strategically located near Eastern Express Highway, Lamington Road, and Maharshi Karve Road, this project provides easy access to various modes of transportation, making it a coveted address. With a RERA registration number P51900003402, Fair Deal Ocean 360 ensures transparency and quality in its construction.\n\nResidents of Fair Deal Ocean 360 can enjoy a luxurious lifestyle with a host of amenities, including a well-equipped gym, designed to keep you fit and healthy. For added convenience, the project also boasts power backup systems, ensuring that you never have to worry about the lights going out. With attention to detail, each apartment is crafted with precision, featuring oil-bound distemper walls in the master bedroom. The unique specifications of Fair Deal Ocean 360 will make you feel like you re living in a 5-star hotel.\n\nChoose from our range of 3 BHK apartment options, carefully designed to provide maximum comfort and space. Each apartment has an area of 1496 Sq. Ft., 1535 Sq. Ft., and 1650 Sq. Ft., respectively, with prices starting from 6.87 Cr to 7.58 Cr. Don t miss this opportunity to own your dream home at Fair Deal Ocean 360.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Fair Deal Ocean 360:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1496 | 6.87 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1535 | 7.05 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1650 | 7.58 Cr |\n\nThe residential property is strategically located near several notable landmarks, providing residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also offer a unique blend of convenience and comfort.\n\nWe have total 25 options available in Fair Deal Ocean 360 for resale and rental, In resale we have 15 properties available ranging from 3 BHK - 6 BHK having sizes from 9.00 CR - 18.00 CR\n\nFor rent you can check 10 properties having options for 3 BHK - 5 BHK with price ranging from 2.00 L - 18.00 L.\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 15 | 3 BHK - 6 BHK | 9.00 CR - 18.00 CR |\n| Rental | 10 | 3 BHK - 5 BHK | 2.00 L - 18.00 L |\n\n## Fair Deal Ocean 360 Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Fair Deal Ocean 360.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1496 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 6.87 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1535 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 7.05 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1650 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 7.58 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nWalkeshwar's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Walkeshwar |\n| --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 84050 |\n| Mar 2026 | 95000 |\n| Dec 2025 | 112250 |\n| Sep 2025 | 94550 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Walkeshwar ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Fair Deal Ocean 360 | In Walkeshwar |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Fair Deal Ocean 360.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times acr